The oodle-loader module downloads Oodle compression native libraries at runtime from
WorkingRobot/OodleUE (https://github.com/WorkingRobot/OodleUE), which redistributes the
Oodle SDK binaries built by Epic Games (proprietary Oodle license — see the README there).
These binaries are hash-pinned, never committed to this repository, and are used under
Epic's Sdk redistribution terms as provided by that mirror.
